  "zoom": 1
}


:: SYS Init [startup]
{
(set: $name to "Jordan")
(set: $stress to 25)
(set: $energy to 70)
(set: $minutesLate to 0)
(set: $money to 40)
(set: $choices to (dm:
  "pressedShirt", false,
  "snoozed", false,
  "tookRideshare", false
))
(set: $log to (a:))
(set: $showStats to true)
}


:: SYS StatBar [footer]
{
(set: $stress to (max: 0, (min: 100, $stress)))
(set: $energy to (max: 0, (min: 100, $energy)))
(if: $showStats)[
  <hr>
  ''Stress'' $stress / 100 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ''Energy'' $energy / 100 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ''Wallet'' (print: "$" + (str: $money))
  <br>(display: "SYS Mood")
]
}


:: SYS Mood
{
(if: $stress >= 75)[//Your jaw has been clenched for an hour.//]
(else-if: $stress >= 50)[//Your shoulders are up around your ears.//]
(else-if: $energy <= 25)[//Running on fumes.//]
(else:)[//Steady. For now.//]
}


:: M01 Alarm [act-morning]
6:42 AM. The alarm cuts through a dream you can't hold onto.

Today is the presentation, the one your manager called "a real opportunity to get some visibility." You've rehearsed it in the shower all week.

Your good blue shirt is still draped over the chair, wrinkled from the dryer.

[[Get up and iron the shirt->M02a Iron the Shirt]]
[[Hit snooze. Ten more minutes.->M02b Snooze]]


:: M02a Iron the Shirt [act-morning]
{
(set: $energy to it - 10)
(set: $stress to it - 10)
(set: $choices's pressedShirt to true)
(set: $log to it + (a: "You got up early and pressed your shirt."))
}
The iron hisses. You take your time with the collar the way your grandmother taught you: points first, then the band.

It's a small thing. But you've learned the small things get noticed when you'd rather they didn't.

[[Head out->M03 Out the Door]]


:: M02b Snooze [act-morning]
{
(set: $energy to it + 15)
(set: $stress to it + 15)
(set: $minutesLate to it + 12)
(set: $choices's snoozed to true)
(set: $log to it + (a: "You took the extra sleep."))
}
7:04. You bolt upright. Your body thanks you; your schedule doesn't.

No time for the iron. You pull the shirt on and smooth it with your palms, like that's ever worked.

[[Head out->M03 Out the Door]]


:: M03 Out the Door [act-morning]
(if: $choices's pressedShirt)[You catch yourself in the hallway mirror: crisp collar, clean lines. You look like someone who belongs in the room. You wish you didn't have to check.]
(else:)[You catch yourself in the hallway mirror: creases across the chest. You tug at them twice, then make yourself stop.]

(if: $minutesLate > 10)[
The 7:40 bus is already turning onto your block.

[[Run for the bus->C01 Running for the Bus]]
(if: $money >= 18)[[[Order a rideshare (eighteen bucks)->C01 Rideshare]]]
]
(else:)[
You've got time. The morning air is cool.

[[Walk to the stop->C01 Bus Stop]]
(if: $energy >= 50)[[[Stop at the corner shop for coffee->C01 Corner Shop]]]
]


